      "engine_slug": "verl-v0.9.0",
      "version_constraints": [],
      "notes": "VeOmni exposes contracts that verl's VeOmni engine consumes: top-k forward-KL distillation without materializing student logits, chunked fused log-probs mirroring verl's FusedLinearForPPOFunction, and R2/R3 MoE router replay hooks. VeOmni does not import verl.",
